===Celadon Condominiums===
====3F====
Enter the [[Celadon Condominiums]] building and enter the elevator on 1F. Climb to 3F to visit the [[Game Freak]] Development Room. When you step out of the elevator, {{ga|Lyra}}/{{ga|Ethan}} and Marill rush over to greet you. She/He excitedly tells you that the Sound Designer just showed her/him a cool device, a high-tech machine that plays retro music originally from the [[Game Boy]]. The designer is apparently hoping to give the device to someone who has won all of the [[Kanto]] [[Badge]]s. Lyra/Ethan suggests that you go for it, then hurries off. The Sound Designer can be found standing near the large globe in the corner. Speak to him after obtaining all 16 Badges, and he rewards you with the [[GB Sounds]].

====Rooftop====
After the sun sets, enter the [[Celadon Condominiums]] building and climb the stairs to 2F. There are two elevators here. The left-hand elevator is inaccessible from here, and leads between 1F, 3F, and the roof. Take the right-hand elevator instead to reach the rooftop's inner area. Speak to the man in the exterior room to hear a scary story, and receive a [[Spell Tag]] for listening to the entire thing.

===Restaurant===
The restaurant on the south side of town is currently hosting an eat-a-thon. It seems as though [[Maylene]] is no pushover!

===Game Corner===
[[File:Celadon Game Corner Inside HGSS.png|thumb|Game Corner]]

The prizes offered next door are expensive, so it will require a large number of coins to receive all of them. Like the one in [[Goldenrod City]], the [[Celadon Game Corner]] features only the [[Voltorb Flip]] card game.

