====A Hidden Power====
Speak to the Guitarist standing next to the counter, and he mentions how his secret skill allows him to identify a Pokémon's hidden power. The move {{m|Hidden Power}} changes its type based on an individual Pokémon's attributes, which can give the user a valuable way to cover its weaknesses. Show the man a Pokémon, and he reveals the type that {{m|Hidden Power}} would take if used by the Pokémon. 

