=====The Masked Man=====
A masked man can be seen standing near the counter on 2F. Speak to him, and he assumes that you want his [[Crasher Wake]] mask, and adamantly refuses to ever let it go. He then realizes that you were more interested in the other mask that he was examining, and gives you the [[Accessory|Turtwig Mask]] Accessory instead. The man eventually gives you a [[Accessory|Chimchar Mask]] and [[Accessory|Piplup Mask]], as well. He has already paid for them, and gives them as a gift from "the one who wears masks the best".

